# name	repository			pipeline
# Tab separated. Copy to config/projects.tsv, which is gitignored.
# "repository" must be exactly owner/name form prefixed with github.com, three
# slash separated parts. A URL form has five parts and is rejected with
# 400 invalid_repository.
# "pipeline" is optional and names one from GET /api/v1/pipelines. Empty means
# the server's default single stage pipeline. Anything that should be reviewed
# needs a three stage pipeline: see Gap 10 and Gap 11 in fork-notes.md.
# Delivery is deliberately absent. It is a per project setting held by the
# server and set in the cockpit, and the orchestrator must not override it.
scratch	github.com/rexchao1/factory-scratch	Implement, review, deliver
